  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"v equals minus StartFraction w Over 150 x EndFraction\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>w</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The given equation relates the distinct positive numbers <math alttext=\"v\"><mi>v</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"w\"><mi>w</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>. Which equation correctly expresses <math alttext=\"w\"><mi>w</mi>\n</math> in terms of <math alttext=\"v\"><mi>v</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
