  "rationale": "<p>Choice A is correct. It&rsquo;s given that <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is positive. Therefore, multiplying each side of the given equation by <math alttext=\"minus 150 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>150</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"minus 150 x v equals w\"><mo>-</mo><mn>150</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"w equals minus 150 v x\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>w</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>150</mn>\n\t\t<mi>v</mi>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Thus, the equation <math alttext=\"w equals minus 150 v x\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>w</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>150</mn>\n\t\t<mi>v</mi>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math> correctly expresses <math alttext=\"w\"><mi>w</mi>\n</math> in terms of <math alttext=\"v\"><mi>v</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>.</p>\n<p>Choice B is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"v equals minus StartFraction w x Over 150 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>v</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>w</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>150</mn>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p>Choice C is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"v equals minus StartFraction x Over 150 w EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>v</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>150</mn>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>w</mi>\n\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p>Choice D is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"v equals w minus 150 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>v</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>w</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>150</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>",
